# F5 theorem (final): self-recursion crashes the graph aggregate publisher.
# 1792 -> 11 -> 2 lines. A relation invoking ITSELF with literal arguments
# reaches publishApplicationResultAggregate and returns InvalidAggregateFact
# (a raw internal error; the stack trace leaks into the diagnostic) instead
# of a classified refusal. crash/ctrl.id is the non-self-recursive control:
# identical shape (same undeclared result descriptor, same call form) with
# the call target renamed produces a CLEAN return-type diagnostic.
parse_expr: Res = (src: str, pos: i64)
    r = parse_expr(src, 0)
